<title>USA: Multimedia Games in pact on TV game show.</title>
<headline>Multimedia Games in pact on TV game show.</headline>
<dateline>TULSA, Okla. 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Multimedia Games Inc said Thursday it had entered into an agreement with Jonathan Goodson Productions to produce and distribute a televised bingo-style game show based on MegaBingo, a million dollar bingo game.</p>
<p>MegaBingo is run by Multimedia Games twice a night, linking more than 60 high-stakes Indian bingo halls across the U.S.</p>
<p>Goodson Productions is affiliated with Viacom Inc's Paramount Television.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
